```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disconnected: BootstrapSession
    Connected --> ConnectionLost: ReportConnectionLost
    Connected --> Disconnected: CloseConnection
    ConnectionLost --> Abandoned: AbandonSession
    ConnectionLost --> Disconnected: CloseConnection
    Disconnected --> Connected: EstablishConnection
    Abandoned --> [*]
```

**操作说明**

| 名称 | 说明 |
| --- | --- |
| `BootstrapSession` | 创建尚未连线的设备会话 |
| `EstablishConnection` | 解析连接串、选择驱动并 connect，成功则进入 Connected |
| `ReportConnectionLost` | 网络异常导致连接意外断开 |
| `CloseConnection` | graceful close 回到 Disconnected |
| `AbandonSession` | 无法恢复的连接丢失进入终态 Abandoned |
